; Output: LOOP.M
; Console: LOOP.OUT
; PMDMML.MAN §10-1, §10-2

#Title LOOP
#Option /v/c

; --- §10 MML Commands - Loop Control Section ---

; §10-1 Local Loop Setting ([ : ])
A [ c d e ]2 f          ; Basic loop 2 times
A [ c : d e ]3 f        ; Loop 3 times, skip d e on last iteration
A [ [c d]2 e ]2 f      ; Nested loop

; §10-2 Overall Loop Setting (L)
A c d e L f g a         ; Overall loop point (repeats from L)

; Exercise repeats, alternate endings, ties, slurs

; Part A: simple nested repeat and tie
A t120 o4 l8 [cdef]2 a4
A c8d8e8f8 c2&c2

; Part B: simple ties and dotted lengths
B l4 c c&c d d&d e2 f.

; Part C: long repeat
C l16 [cdefgabc]2

; Part D: note length modifiers and dotted notes
D l8 c. d.. e1... f2&f4

; Part E: change default length mid-stream
E l4 c d l8 e f l16 g a l8 b>c<

; Rhythm hint via rests and spacing
R0 l8 r r r r
R1 l8 r r r r
K R0 R1

; --- Part H: Nested loops ---
H @1 [c d e]2 f
H [c : d e]3 f
H [[c d]2 e]2 f
H c d e L f g a

A l8 [c d]2   ; repeat_count=2 loop

; Loop with break for lc coverage of 0xf9/0xf8/0xf7
A [c d : e f]2 g

; Simple loop for lc coverage
A [c d e]2
